  "body": "Having tried a few things, including downloading the tar.xz file again, I've found that the two hidden files `.ART.bin` and `.ART-cli.bin` aren't being copied to `/opt` by my `cp' copy command.\n\nIn 1.25.2 these two files aren't hidden, which is why my `cp` command worked for that and previous versions.\n\nHaving modified my `cp` command to copy the hidden files, ART still has the same error but it now works.\n\nThanks for looking into this as I doubt I would have found the underlying issue otherwise.\n\n\n",
